    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>From the developer:</strong> <i>Dear friends, this game is not a hate piece against neural networks.  Rather, it is a multifaceted reflection on the new reality.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597530/extras/3a70277347eb05a78d5cbf2e7a950287.avif?t=1742057263\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc19 <strong>Simple gameplay keeps the focus on the story.</strong> Can you uncover every ending?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc19 <strong>Almost everything here is sculpted from clay.</strong> What could be more human than that...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc19 <strong>A short story filled with big questions.</strong> Is a human <i>truly</i> better than a neural network? Find your own answer.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>From the developer:</strong> <i>Dear friends, this game is not a hate piece against neural networks.  Rather, it is a multifaceted reflection on the new reality.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597530/extras/3a70277347eb05a78d5cbf2e7a950287.avif?t=1742057263\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc19 <strong>Simple gameplay keeps the focus on the story.</strong> Can you uncover every ending?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc19 <strong>Almost everything here is sculpted from clay.</strong> What could be more human than that...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc19 <strong>A short story filled with big questions.</strong> Is a human <i>truly</i> better than a neural network? Find your own answer.</p>",
